                            <comment id="15746956" author="luciano resende" created="Wed, 14 Dec 2016 02:09:42 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I could find couple issues with https (latest release as well as master):&lt;br/&gt;
1) always use server port, instead of SSL port when SSL is enabled&lt;br/&gt;
2) the zeppelin-site.xml says that if you are not using truststore for client auth the properties would default to keystore, but in my tests, I noticed that you MUST setup the truststore properties to point to keystore otherwise you will get some NPE in the logs. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If you workaround the items above, it seems to work then. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Let me do some further investigation on other scenarios, and prepare a PR with code fixes and documentation updates on how to setup SSL.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
